title: Minor Ballad
key: Am
tempo: 80
style: acoustic

// A slow tune in two parts: the first falls from the one and comes home through
// the five, the second opens on the six and climbs to the relative major.
[A]
| Am | Em | F  | C  |
| Dm | Am | E7 | Am |

[B]
| F  | G  | C  | Am |
| Dm | E7 | Am | %  |
